# GitHub repositories whose latest release is published in this feed.
#
# One "owner/repo" per line. build-feed.sh takes the newest non-draft,
# non-prerelease release of each and collects every .ipk and .apk asset
# attached to it. Adding a package to the feed is adding a line here.
#
# The source repositories need no changes of their own. They do not know
# this feed exists.

